#################################
##	Sample of Behavior file

Behavior

PyrRotate		0 360 0
StartJitter		9 0 9

FadeInLength		10
FadeOutLength		60

Scale			4.0  20  4.0		### Y= Height of Cylinder from center
ScaleRate		1.3 1.5 1.3
 EndScale		12 20 12 		

SplatFlags			ADDITIVE ROUNDTEXTURE
SplatSetBack		0.5     #0 -> 1.0 splatSetBack = what percent of the splat should be behind the node, and what in front

SplatFalloffType	BOTH			# UP DOWN NONE BOTH	
SplatFadeCenter		0.5				# only for UP and DOWN falloff
		
Alpha			120

StartColor		230 244 255

ByTime1			11  
BeColor1		255 176 19

ByTime2			25
BeColor2		200 108 10

ByTime3			35  
BeColor3		50 50 50

ByTime4			40 
BeColor4		230 244 255

End


